LightNav real-world deployment integration

This repository incorporates LightNav-0 by lightorigins / LightOrigins,
upstream https://github.com/lightorigins/LightNav-0,
base commit 3015508b70fb6e30bbd66701e94c9b916dcb8df8.
The upstream Apache-2.0 license and attribution are retained.

Local deployment changes were restored from an existing Go2 / RealSense
runtime snapshot and workstation changes. See docs/REALWORLD_PROVENANCE.md
and deployment/source-manifest.json for provenance.

Unitree SDK2, CycloneDDS, ROS 2, RealSense drivers, and model weights are
external dependencies with their own licenses; they are not vendored here.
